          <h3>Full Stack Developer & AI Researcher</h3>
          <p>
            I write software and I do computer vision research. Nine years of the first, and a Master's in Computer
            Science from Northeastern for the second. The work I like best sits where the two meet, taking a model
            that only runs in a notebook and turning it into something people can actually use.
          </p>
          <p>
            My research is in computer vision and deep learning, mostly medical imaging and explainable AI, with three
            papers on arXiv. Along the way I have built systems that classify skin cancer, estimate depth from a
            single photo, and read the titles off a shelf of books.
          </p>
          <div class="xp-system-info">
            <div class="xp-system-info-row">
              <span class="xp-system-info-label">System:</span>
              <span class="xp-system-info-value">Sukhrob Ilyosbekov v9.0</span>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-system-info-row">
              <span class="xp-system-info-label">Role:</span>
              <span class="xp-system-info-value">Senior Full Stack Developer | AI Researcher</span>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-system-info-row">
              <span class="xp-system-info-label">Location:</span>
              <span class="xp-system-info-value">Boston, MA</span>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-system-info-row">
              <span class="xp-system-info-label">Education:</span>
