                  <div class="xp-research-content">
                    <div class="xp-research-title">MorphoCLIP: Text-Supervised Cell Painting Retrieval</div>
                    <div class="xp-research-desc">
                      Matches Cell Painting microscopy images of drug- and gene-perturbed cells to descriptions of the
                      treatment written in ordinary language. The vision and language backbones (DINOv3, BioClinical
                      ModernBERT) stay frozen and only small projection heads train, so the whole thing fits on one
                      consumer GPU. Tested on the CPJUMP1 benchmark: 51 plates, 3M+ images.
                    </div>
                    <div class="xp-research-tags">
                      <span>PyTorch</span>
                      <span>DINOv3</span>
                      <span>BioClinical ModernBERT</span>
                      <span>Contrastive Learning</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="xp-research-links">
                      <a href="https://github.com/suxrobgm/morphoclip" target="_blank">
