                <!-- Research 3 -->
                <li class="xp-research-item">
                  <div class="xp-research-icon"><i class="fas fa-microscope"></i></div>
                  <div class="xp-research-content">
                    <div class="xp-research-title">MelanomaNet: Explainable Skin Lesion Classification</div>
                    <div class="xp-research-desc">
                      An EfficientNet V2 classifier over all nine ISIC 2019 diagnostic categories. The interesting
                      part is what happens after the prediction: GradCAM++ heatmaps get broken down along the ABCDE
                      criteria dermatologists already work from, so a clinician can check what the model looked at.
                    </div>
                    <div class="xp-research-tags">
                      <span>PyTorch</span>
                      <span>EfficientNet V2</span>
                      <span>GradCAM++</span>
                      <span>OpenCV</span>
                    </div>
