                      </a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </li>
                <!-- Research 5 -->
                <li class="xp-research-item">
                  <div class="xp-research-icon"><i class="fas fa-expand"></i></div>
                  <div class="xp-research-content">
                    <div class="xp-research-title">FSRCNN: Super-Resolution Neural Network (course project)</div>
                    <div class="xp-research-desc">
                      A reproduction of FSRCNN for single-image super-resolution. Upsampling is learned end to end,
                      which is where the 40x speedup over SRCNN comes from. The reported gains held up on Set5 (+1.78
                      dB PSNR) and Set14 (+1.26 dB PSNR), with extra ablations on the shrinking and mapping layers.
                    </div>
                    <div class="xp-research-tags">
